<title>MALAYSIA: Pacific &amp; Orient year net down 7.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Pacific &amp; Orient year net down 7.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   49.71	  vs	  53.39</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)  50.0	   vs	  54.0</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)  15.0	   vs	  15.0</p>
<p>Turnover</p>
<p>252.02 vs 237.01</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     70.46	  vs	  78.26</p>
<p>NOTE: the company's full name is Pacific &amp; Orient Bhd. It is in the business of insurance and investment holding.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
